                                "example_id": "0885a503-c1c6-451d-a28d-1b0da764fee7",
                                "sense_id": "3570efd7-be6d-3f55-854f-70458df7f3a7",
                                "text": "“I didn’t think you loved me so much as this, my Margarita!” he said, in a broken voice. She did not answer, but she clung to him as a child clings to its mother, and the end was, they remained in town together. It seemed as though Fate interposed to prevent the two Margaritas meeting again."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
